### Resolved category IDs
@lighting_category_id = {{lightingCategory.response.body.$.id}}
@furniture_category_id = {{furnitureCategory.response.body.$.id}}
@decor_category_id = {{decorCategory.response.body.$.id}}
@art_category_id = {{artCategory.response.body.$.id}}

### Lighting item 1
# @name lightingAntique1
POST {{app}}/api/antiques
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf_token}}

{
  "title":"Murano glass pendant lamp",
  "artistId":"{{artistId}}",
  "categoryId":"{{lighting_category_id}}",
  "description":"Hand-blown amber glass pendant lamp.",
  "price":780.00
}

### Resolved lighting antique ID
@lighting_antique_1_id = {{lightingAntique1.response.body.$.id}}

### Upload a local binary image for Lighting item 1
PUT {{app}}/api/antiques/{{lighting_antique_1_id}}/image
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=antiqueImageBoundary

--antiqueImageBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="ceramic-lamp.svg"
Content-Type: image/svg+xml

< ../galerie_de_ruiter_frontend_app/public/images/antiques/ceramic-lamp.svg
--antiqueImageBoundary--

